WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Found a price, stock value or description that needs fixing while reviewing your catalogue?

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
With Pep Logar Frontend Product Editor + AI, edit the product you are viewing directly from the storefront.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
The extension even identifies the selected combination. Change price, stock or content and review every difference.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Save and verify the result. Improve descriptions with AI, optimise for SEO, translate or dictate.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:37.000
Work inside the original Back Office fields. It installs in Chrome or Edge, with no modules and no code changes.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Compatible with PrestaShop 1.6, 1.7, 8 and 9. See it. Edit it.

